<li><a href="#s-tests-features-501-search--search-admin-guest">Search &lt;admin&gt; &amp; guest</a><span class="slow-bar"><span class="bar pass" style="width:33.3%"></span></span><span class="slow-ms">40 ms</span></li>
</ol>
<h2 class="section-h" id="scenarios">Scenarios</h2>
<details class="scenario pass" id="s-tests-features-501-search--search-admin-guest">
<summary><span class="pill pass">passed</span> <span class="loc">tests/features/501_search.feature</span> Search &lt;admin&gt; &amp; guest <a class="artifact" href="artifacts/tests-features-501-search--search-admin-guest.hurl">artifact</a></summary>
<ol class="steps">
<li class="pass"><span class="glyph">✓</span> the admin searches for &quot;Jansen&quot;<span class="meta">:6 · 1× · 40ms</span><span class="track"><span class="bar pass" style="margin-left:0.0%;width:100.0%"></span></span></li>
</ol>
